  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I would like to request some more icons for profile link.  It also helps with clarity on links so people know what they are pressing as I do assume most creators will like to link their work to their profile. I noted that you guys have ones for booth, twitter, twitch as well and I do believe extras that cater to the creator community will help. As you already have booth I would assume that gumroad, github, gitlabs and tip jars should fall under the same category.\nSpecifically ones as listed are most common in the creator community:\n- gumroad\n- GitHub\n- payhip\n- linktree\n- Gitlab\n- tipjars (such as Ko-fi, cashapp, paypal)",
